    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow that's a really powerful way to frame it. i think that's exactly the angle i'm looking for. if the old arguments are basically just relics of a world that doesn't exist anymore, do you think there's even any legitimate economic reason to oppose UBI at this point, or is it just political inertia?",
